note C1 boundary control: in an OM-1 unit an array parameter without its length stays error 16
note (OMEGESE 9.4: "An array parameter ... written without its length is refused (error 16)"),
note reported on the fn line (line 5).
fn f v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn main to int
ret 0
end
